{{About|the history of the region|the history of states known as Palestine|History of Palestinian statehood}}
{{redirect2|Historic Palestine|Historical Palestine|the historical region itself|Palestine (region)}}
{{pp-extended|small=yes}}
{{Very long|date=February 2023|words=17,988}}
