{{History of Palestine}}
{{multiple images
 | total_width = 300
 | image1 = Heinrich Kiepert 1841 map of Palestine (combined).jpg
 | image2 = Modern Palestine, Illustrated atlas, and modern history of the World, 1851.jpg
 | image3 = Palestine with the Hauran and the adjacent districts, William Hughes 1843.jpg
 | width1 = 103
